{{also|honduras|Hondúras|Hondūras}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{der|en|es|honduras|t=depths|pos=referring to the deep waters off the northern coast}}.<br>It may also come from the alleged Columbus quote, "''Gracias a Dios que hemos salido de esas honduras"'' ("Thank god we have departed from those depths"), said during his fourth and final voyage in 1502.

